        "start": 124.018,
        "end": 126.006,
        "duration": 1.988,
        "midpoint": 125.012,
        "text": "为什么不要妄图用ai起号呢？",
        "frame": "evidence/6a3ba6950000000007027cc5/transcript-frames/cue-046.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "index": 47,
        "start": 126.006,
        "end": 127.852,
        "duration": 1.846,
        "midpoint": 126.929,
        "text": "因为ai只能做六十分的视频",
        "frame": "evidence/6a3ba6950000000007027cc5/transcript-frames/cue-047.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
