      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "index": 51,
        "start": 138.6,
        "end": 140.522,
        "duration": 1.922,
        "midpoint": 139.561,
        "text": "你以为这是你坚持的结果吗？不是啊",
        "frame": "evidence/6a3ba6950000000007027cc5/transcript-frames/cue-051.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "index": 52,
        "start": 140.522,
        "end": 143.645,
        "duration": 3.123,
        "midpoint": 142.084,
        "text": "是你之前做的东西都是屎，然后你突然开窍了，这才是起号",
        "frame": "evidence/6a3ba6950000000007027cc5/transcript-frames/cue-052.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "index": 53,
        "start": 143.645,
        "end": 147.61,
        "duration": 3.965,
        "midpoint": 145.627,
        "text": "你可以让ai在你写作的过程中去补齐你一些知识上的缺陷，也可以让ai",
        "frame": "evidence/6a3ba6950000000007027cc5/transcript-frames/cue-053.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "index": 54,
        "start": 147.62,
        "end": 149.095,
        "duration": 1.475,
        "midpoint": 148.358,
        "text": "和你进行聊天去头脑风暴",
        "frame": "evidence/6a3ba6950000000007027cc5/transcript-frames/cue-054.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-055",
        "index": 55,
        "start": 149.095,
        "end": 151.911,
        "duration": 2.816,
        "midpoint": 150.503,
        "text": "但是绝对不要去做那种用ai一键生成你的脚本",
